#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:6084
#, no-c-format
msgid "&no-i18n-plugin_lowpass; (Low Pass Filter)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:6092
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot of the Low Pass Filter Plugin"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: literal
#: index.docbook:6099
#, no-c-format
msgid "&no-i18n-plugin_lowpass;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:6108
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Applies a simple low pass filter to the current selection. A low pass filter "
"lets frequencies below a <emphasis>border frequency</emphasis> pass and "
"filters out frequencies that are above the border frequency."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:6113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The filter has grade two and is implemented as described in the book "
"<citetitle>\"The manifold joys of conformal mapping, applications to digital "
"filtering in the studio</citetitle> by <author> <personname> "
"<firstname>James A.</firstname> <surname>Moorer</surname> </personname> </"
"author> (JAES, Vol. 31, No. 11, 1983 November)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:6134
#, no-c-format
msgid "The border frequency of the low pass filter in Hz."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:6147
#, no-c-format
msgid "&no-i18n-plugin_memory; (Memory Settings)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:6155
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot of the Memory Setup Plugin"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: literal
#: index.docbook:6162
#, no-c-format
msgid "&no-i18n-plugin_memory;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:6171
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Provides a dialog to set up the memory usage of &kwave;. Please refer to the "
"section about the <link linkend=\"memory-setup\" endterm=\"sect_title_memory-"
"setup\"></link> in this manual for more information."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: replaceable
#: index.docbook:6184
#, no-c-format
msgid "physical limited"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:6186
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If zero, the use of physical memory will not limited, otherwise the use of "
"physical memory will be limited."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: replaceable
#: index.docbook:6194
#, no-c-format
msgid "physical limit"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:6196
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Limitation of the physical memory in units of whole MB. Only has an effect "
"when the parameter <replaceable>physical limited</replaceable> has been set "
"to a non zero value."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: replaceable
#: index.docbook:6206
#, no-c-format
msgid "virtual enabled"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:6208
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If zero, the use of virtual memory will be disabled, otherwise the use of "
"virtual memory will be enabled."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: replaceable
#: index.docbook:6216
#, no-c-format
msgid "virtual limited"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:6218
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If zero, the use of virtual memory will be not limited, otherwise the use of "
"virtual memory will be limited. Only has an effect if the parameter "
"<replaceable>virtual enabled</replaceable> has been set to a non zero value."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: replaceable
#: index.docbook:6229
#, no-c-format
msgid "virtual limit"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:6231
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Limitation of the virtual memory in units of whole MB. Only has an effect if "
"the parameters <replaceable>virtual enabled</replaceable> and "
"<replaceable>virtual limited</replaceable> have both been set to a non zero "
"value."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: replaceable
#: index.docbook:6241
#, no-c-format
msgid "virtual directory"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:6243
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Directory to use for storing swap files that will be used for providing "
"virtual memory. Only has an effect if the parameter <replaceable>virtual "
"enabled</replaceable> has been set to a non zero value."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:6260
#, no-c-format
